OL,3,APensions and benefits services still
OL,4,Adown after 'cyber incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnline benefits and pensions services
OL,7,Fwere still down on Saturday morning
OL,8,Ffollowing a "cyber incident" which
OL,9,Fforced the government to take them
OL,10,Foffline.
OL,12,FThe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,13,F(DWP) has not specified what triggered
OL,14,Fit to shut down access late on Thursday
OL,15,Fbut has not ruled out that it was hit
OL,16,Fby hackers.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
