OL,3,ACatherine's emotional cancer
OL,4,Adocumentary strips away the stiff upper
OL,5,Alip
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis is royal television without any
OL,8,Fpalaces or carriages, it's an intense
OL,9,F30 minutes examining how "cancer strips
OL,10,Feverything away" and then a different
OL,11,Fkind of self-awareness emerges.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
