OL,3,AMan arrested on suspicion of murdering
OL,4,Agirl, 16
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man was arrested at Stansted
OL,7,FAirport on Friday evening and remains
OL,8,Fin police custody. The Met said it
OL,9,Fbelieved it to be an isolated incident
OL,10,Fand the suspect was known to the
OL,11,Fvictim.
OL,13,FThe girl's family have been informed
OL,14,Fand are being supported by specialist
OL,15,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
