OL,3,AAfghanistan explosion kills 10 students
OL,4,Aand injures more than 100, official
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FPosting on X, Abdul Mateen Qani said
OL,8,Fthat according to initial
OL,9,Finvestigations, the blast was caused by
OL,10,F"negligence and carelessness" at an
OL,11,Fexplosives depot belonging to nearby
OL,12,Fmining companies.
OL,14,FAn investigation into the incident was
OL,15,Fongoing, he added.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
