OL,3,ASpanish PM and rivals rally supporters
OL,4,Ain final pitch for votes
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpain's main party leaders have held
OL,7,Ftheir final rallies ahead of Sunday's
OL,8,Felection, with Socialist Prime Minister
OL,9,FPedro Sanchez saying he is confident of
OL,10,Fdefying the polls.
OL,12,F"I cannot imagine us losing," he said,
OL,13,Fposing for selfies with supporters in
OL,14,Fred T-shirts and accusing conservative
OL,15,Frival Alberto Nunez Feijoo of planning
OL,16,Fa coalition with the far right.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
