OL,3,ASpanish PM and rivals rally supporters
OL,4,Ain final pitch for votes
OL,5,
OL,6,FFeijoo's People's Party (PP) is
OL,7,Fnarrowly ahead in the polls, and in the
OL,8,Ffinal hours of the campaign he
OL,9,Ftravelled first to Barcelona and then
OL,10,FSeville, promising voters a new
OL,11,Fpolitical era of "truth, decency and
OL,12,Fgood governance".
OL,14,FHe accused Sanchez of evading questions
OL,15,Fon key issues like corruption, rail
OL,16,Fdisasters, immigration and the national
OL,17,Fdebt.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
